1
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,911
As Uke comes round to the strike

2
00:00:03,912 --> 00:00:05,144
raise both arms

3
00:00:05,545 --> 00:00:07,833
lead the strike round into a big circle

4
00:00:07,834 --> 00:00:10,234
as you do so control Uke´s elbow,

5
00:00:10,535 --> 00:00:11,587
as Uke turns

6
00:00:11,588 --> 00:00:15,385
slide in deeply controlling
the back of the neck and shoulder,

7
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:18,762
step in deep again behind and throw down.

